* Fender Bassbreaker 18/30 power amp, from the Fender service diagram (drawing 7706436000 rev A): V2-B (12AX7A) as a cathodyne phase inverter (56k plate and cathode loads, 1k with 22u in the cathode, 100k stopper,
* 1M returns, C10 .01 and C11 .022 in front), 47k stoppers and 470k leaks into four 6BQ5 / EL84 as two parallel pairs on one cathode (two 150 ohm / 5 W in parallel with 47u), 220 ohm screen resistors, no negative
* feedback, and the supply: a silicon bridge into 47u (node a, integrated by the engine), then 3.9k / 3.9k / 10k with 47u, 22u and 22u to the 310, 295 and 265 V nodes.
*
* Assumptions where the drawing is silent or ambiguous (change them here, not in code):
*  - the output transformer (7706441000) has no impedance printed: 4k plate-to-plate onto the 16 ohm tap, 6 H per primary half, 40 ohm per half, coupling like the other amps (the AC30's EL84 transformer);
*  - the screens take the same voltage as the plates (the drawing feeds them from the B+ through a MOSFET follower, Q3, which this model does not have); the 18 W mode (a lower screen voltage and the 240 ohm
*    R35 in the cathode) is not in this model: it is the 30 W amp;
*  - the diode in front of the 3.9k (D21, 1N4006) is a 0.7 V drop folded into the supply source; the bleeder and the preamp's draw are RPREAMP;
*  - the plate catch diodes (D13, D14, R3000) only matter on the flyback of the output transformer and are left out.

.nodes pin g10 gp gpi ppl kpi kl ga gb g1 g2 s1 s2 kc pt pbm npt npb a y z x tt t16

S VAUDIO pin 40k 0
S VHT a 20 340

* Phase inverter V2-B: C10 .01 and R18 1M, C11 .022, 100k stopper, 1M return to the cathode-load node.
C C10 pin g10 10n
R R18 g10 0 1M
C C11 g10 gp 22n
R R65 gp gpi 100k
R R19 gp kl 1M
T V2B gpi ppl kpi 12AX7
R R21 y ppl 56k
R R20 kpi kl 1k
C C12 kpi kl 22u
R R22 kl 0 56k
C C13 ppl ga 47n
C C14 kl gb 47n

* Grid circuits: 47k stoppers (two in parallel per side) and a 470k leak to ground.
R R23 ga 0 470k
R R24 gb 0 470k
R RS_A ga g1 47k/2
R RS_B gb g2 47k/2

* EL84: V3 + V5 on one half of the primary, V4 + V6 on the other; common cathode 75 ohm (two 150 ohm) with 47u; 220 ohm screen resistors.
P V3 g1 pt s1 kc EL84 2
P V4 g2 pbm s2 kc EL84 2
R RK kc 0 75
C C15 kc 0 47u
R RZ1 z s1 220/2
R RZ2 z s2 220/2
R RZ a z 20
C CZ z 0 1u

* Output transformer: primary halves around the B+ centre tap (node a), one 16 ohm secondary.
R DCR_PT pt npt 40
R DCR_PB pbm npb 40
.param n16 = 2*1/sqrt(4000/16)
.xfmr OT L=6 SAT=1.6
  W npt a 1 pri
  W a npb 1 pri
  W t16 0 n16 sec
  K pri pri 0.9998
  K pri sec 0.9993
.end
R RLOAD t16 0 16

* Supply after the 47u reservoir (node a): 3.9k to the 295 V node (y, 22u: the phase inverter's plate load), 10k to the 265 V node (x, 22u: the preamp); the 3.9k in front of them is folded in.
R R47 a tt 3.9k
C C26 tt 0 47u
R R48 tt y 3.9k
C C27 y 0 22u
R R49 y x 10k
C C28 x 0 22u
R RPREAMP x 0 90k
